# Upload only what the site serves: the holding page, the game with the engine and text it
# imports, and web/ (Daylight, its fonts, the demo save). Everything else (vendor's docs and
# sheet, runner/, verify/, tests, reports) stays off the site, so a path like
# /vendor/dry-run-engine/SIMULATION-MATHS.md is a 404.
/*
!/index.html
!/vercel.json
!/web
!/vendor
/vendor/*
!/vendor/dry-run-engine
/vendor/dry-run-engine/*
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/game
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/engine
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/text
